  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two identical blocks, X and Y, each of mass 2.0 kg are connected by a string. They move on the same surface.</p>\n<p>A force F accelerates the blocks at 0.5 m s<sup>−2</sup>. The frictional force on block X is 4.0 N.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the tension in the string?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">1 N</li><li data-label=\"B\">2 N</li><li data-label=\"C\">5 N</li><li data-label=\"D\">10 N</li></ol>"
  },
